---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import Header from "../components/Header.astro";
import Footer from "../components/Footer.astro";
---

<Layout 
  title="Privacy Policy | FreeInjuryCalc"
  description="Read the privacy policies of FreeInjuryCalc.com. Discover how we manage log files, cookies, and Google AdSense advertisement protocols."
>
  <Header />

  <main class="flex-grow bg-canvas transition-colors duration-200 py-16 md:py-24">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 font-sans">
      
      <!-- Page Header -->
      <div class="border-b border-hairline pb-8 mb-12">
        <span class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-link font-mono bg-link-bg-soft/30 dark:bg-link-bg-soft/10 px-3 py-1 rounded-full">
          Data Transparency
        </span>
        <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-5xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-ink mt-4 mb-4">
          Privacy Policy
        </h1>
        <p class="text-sm md:text-base text-body leading-relaxed">
          Last updated: June 10, 2026. Your privacy is paramount. Learn how we handle cookies, advertising partners, and anonymous analytical data.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Policy Content -->
      <div class="space-y-8 text-xs md:text-sm text-body leading-relaxed">
        
        <div class="space-y-4">
          <h2 class="text-lg md:text-xl font-bold text-ink">1. Information We Collect</h2>
          <p>
            FreeInjuryCalc.com does not require user registration or any form of sign-up. We do not collect personally identifiable information (PII) such as names, phone numbers, home addresses, or social security numbers. Any inputs entered into our calculator engines (e.g., medical expense amounts, hourly wage calculations) are processed strictly in-browser or on-the-fly and are never permanently recorded or associated with your identity on our databases.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="space-y-4">
          <h2 class="text-lg md:text-xl font-bold text-ink">2. Log Files</h2>
          <p>
            Like most websites, FreeInjuryCalc.com utilizes standard log files. The information inside these logs includes internet protocol (IP) addresses, browser type, Internet Service Provider (ISP), date/time stamps, referring/exit pages, and the number of clicks. This data is collected purely to analyze trends, administer the site, track user movement, and gather general demographic indicators. This information is not linked to any personally identifiable details.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="space-y-4">
          <h2 class="text-lg md:text-xl font-bold text-ink">3. Cookies</h2>
          <p>
            This website uses cookies. Third-party vendors, including Google, use cookies to serve ads based on a user's prior visits to this website or other websites. Users may opt out of Google's use of cookies by visiting the Google advertising opt-out page at <a href="https://www.google.com/policies/privacy/partners/" class="text-link hover:underline font-mono text-xs">https://www.google.com/policies/privacy/partners/</a>.
          </p>
          <p>
            If you wish to disable cookies, you may do so through your individual browser options. Detailed information about cookie management with specific web browsers can be found at the browsers' respective websites.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="space-y-4">
          <h2 class="text-lg md:text-xl font-bold text-ink">4. Advertising</h2>
          <p>
            We use Google AdSense to display advertisements on our website. Google AdSense uses cookies to serve ads based on your prior visits to this website or other websites. Google's use of advertising cookies enables it and its partners to serve ads to you based on your visit to our site and/or other sites on the Internet. You may opt out of personalized advertising by visiting <a href="https://www.google.com/settings/ads" class="text-link hover:underline font-mono text-xs">https://www.google.com/settings/ads</a>.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="space-y-4">
          <h2 class="text-lg md:text-xl font-bold text-ink">5. Third Party Privacy Policies</h2>
          <p>
            Our Privacy Policy does not apply to other advertisers or websites. We advise you to consult the respective Privacy Policies of these third-party ad servers for more detailed information.
          </p>
          <p>
            Google's Privacy Policy: <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" class="text-link hover:underline font-mono text-xs">https://policies.google.com/privacy</a>
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="space-y-4">
          <h2 class="text-lg md:text-xl font-bold text-ink">6. California Consumer Privacy Act (CCPA) & General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR) Rights</h2>
          <p>
            For users residing in the European Economic Area (EEA) or California, you are entitled to statutory data rights. Because FreeInjuryCalc.com does not collect, store, or sell any personal data or personally identifiable information (PII), we do not maintain data profiles that can be retrieved or deleted.
          </p>
          <p>
            However, you have the right to control cookies and personalized advertising. You can manage your consent preferences at any time through your browser settings or by opting out of personalized advertisements served by Google. Visit Google's Ad Settings to manage the ads you see.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="space-y-4">
          <h2 class="text-lg md:text-xl font-bold text-ink">7. Consent</h2>
          <p>
            By using our website, you hereby consent to our privacy policy and agree to its terms.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="space-y-4 font-sans">
          <h2 class="text-lg md:text-xl font-bold text-ink">8. Contact Information</h2>
          <p>
            If you have any questions or concerns regarding this Privacy Policy, please contact us at:
          </p>
          <p class="font-mono text-xs text-body leading-relaxed">
            Email: <a href="mailto:contact@freeinjurycalc.com" class="text-link hover:underline">contact@freeinjurycalc.com</a><br />
            Mailing Address: FreeInjuryCalc Support Desk, 1209 Orange St, Wilmington, DE 19801, USA
          </p>
        </div>

      </div>

    </div>
  </main>

  <Footer />
</Layout>
